Builders Lab by George Johnson is a paid build-in-public community for builders, entrepreneurs, and operators who want to turn real domain expertise into practical AI-powered systems.\par
\par
Inside the lab, George shares live builds, AI automation workflows, prompts, product decisions, content operations, experiments, and behind-the-scenes lessons from building useful tools in public. The focus is not hype, shortcuts, or a one-size-fits-all AI course. It is practical systems thinking: how to spot valuable problems, design workflows, use AI agents and automation wisely, test ideas, improve outputs, and keep building with judgment.\par
\par
If you are interested in AI systems for entrepreneurs, AI SEO automation, content systems, niche software, or simply watching practical AI projects develop from idea to implementation, Builders Lab gives you a closer look at the process.\par
\par
Join Builders Lab to follow the builds, ask questions, compare notes, and learn alongside other practical builders.\par
